WEBVTT

00:40.290 --> 00:45.003
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:48.923 --> 00:50.091
Bu-yeon and I are married.

00:50.925 --> 00:53.428
So please, give us your blessings.

00:53.511 --> 00:55.430
How can you get married
without my permission?

00:56.014 --> 00:59.350
Jang Uk, I have no intention
of handing my daughter over to you.

00:59.434 --> 01:01.311
Does it look like
I'm asking for your permission here?

01:02.103 --> 01:03.188
As I said,

01:04.022 --> 01:05.440
the two of us are already married.

01:09.402 --> 01:10.278
Bu-yeon.

01:11.571 --> 01:12.572
Answer me, my dear.

01:13.406 --> 01:14.240
Is it true?

01:14.824 --> 01:16.159
My sweet daughter

01:16.242 --> 01:19.079
would never deceive her mother
by marrying a man like him,

01:20.371 --> 01:21.372
would you?

01:22.957 --> 01:24.709
Mother, how could I ever abandon you?

01:25.418 --> 01:27.295
Yes. You wouldn't.

01:27.378 --> 01:29.631
Not my precious daughter!

01:31.508 --> 01:32.342
But I'm sorry.

01:34.344 --> 01:36.471
I cannot continue to live
the way you wish me to, Mother.

01:38.014 --> 01:39.641
And that's why I married this man.

01:41.017 --> 01:41.851
So now…

01:44.312 --> 01:45.230
we will live together.

01:45.313 --> 01:46.564
I don't believe it.

01:47.524 --> 01:48.483
My daughter is lying,

01:48.566 --> 01:50.652
Jang Uk is forcing her
to do this against her will.

01:51.486 --> 01:52.862
Their marriage must be a lie!

01:52.946 --> 01:55.949
Are you going to sit there and watch?
Will you do nothing?

02:14.509 --> 02:15.343
Jang Uk.

02:16.594 --> 02:19.139
Did you not swear
in front of this Assembly

02:19.222 --> 02:22.684
on the life of Park Jin
that you would never abuse your powers.

02:23.268 --> 02:25.061
How dare you marry the heir of Jinyowon

02:25.145 --> 02:26.688
without asking for proper permission!

02:27.272 --> 02:28.940
Leave Jin Bu-yeon and go now.

02:29.524 --> 02:32.277
If you do not drop this claim
and leave right this instant,

02:32.360 --> 02:34.237
Park Jin will bear
the price of your action.

02:34.320 --> 02:36.322
I haven't had to use any of my powers yet.

02:37.282 --> 02:38.199
Are you so afraid of me

02:38.283 --> 02:40.034
that you have to use his life
to threaten me?

02:40.118 --> 02:42.453
Afraid of you?

02:44.706 --> 02:47.959
It seems that you fear nothing,
not when you have that power,

02:48.042 --> 02:49.627
but this is the Unanimous Assembly.

02:49.711 --> 02:51.671
We cannot be frightened
by someone like you.

02:51.754 --> 02:52.589
Okay, then…

02:53.548 --> 02:55.049
please be sure you're watching me

02:56.050 --> 02:58.553
as I take this woman
out of this place with me.

03:11.191 --> 03:13.151
Being the leader is one thing,
but why do I have to take

03:13.234 --> 03:15.153
my uncle's seat at the Unanimous Assembly?

03:15.695 --> 03:17.822
We should hurry. It seems
the Unanimous Assembly has begun.

03:17.906 --> 03:18.740
Yes.

03:31.794 --> 03:35.465
I heard you're now the acting leader.
So of course you have to be here.

03:36.341 --> 03:37.675
So you came too, Young Lady Jin.

03:38.635 --> 03:41.262
Uh, I heard
that your sister was found safe

03:41.346 --> 03:43.014
and that she'll be announced
as the heir tonight.

03:43.097 --> 03:46.559
I heard that you were the one
who shared her portrait all over Daeho.

03:46.643 --> 03:49.103
Yeah, well, that was no trouble at all.

03:49.187 --> 03:50.688
Especially since it was your sister.

03:50.772 --> 03:52.815
I had to do whatever I could to help you.

03:52.899 --> 03:55.068
Why did you do it
when no one asked you to?

03:55.652 --> 03:59.239
Now that everyone knows her face,
she will have to be locked away forever.

04:01.532 --> 04:02.700
Poor thing.

04:03.660 --> 04:05.578
Uh, what? Locked away?

04:15.505 --> 04:17.173
Something must have happened
during the meeting.

04:32.438 --> 04:33.398
Did you see that?

04:33.481 --> 04:35.900
He unleashed such power
without even drawing his sword.

04:35.984 --> 04:37.819
It's the energy of the ice stone.

04:38.778 --> 04:41.823
If Jang Uk wanted to,
he could use that power

04:41.906 --> 04:44.284
- to take every soul gathered here.
- Regardless,

04:44.367 --> 04:46.494
among us are the finest mages of Daeho!

04:46.577 --> 04:48.496
If we allow him to go,
what will that make us?

04:48.579 --> 04:50.373
Everyone, please remain calm.

04:54.794 --> 04:56.713
One side here doesn't believe
they're married,

04:56.796 --> 04:59.090
while the other claims
they've already wed.

04:59.841 --> 05:01.175
So then how about this?

05:01.259 --> 05:04.012
Bring forth a witness
who can verify you two are married.

05:04.095 --> 05:05.096
Why do you need a witness

05:05.179 --> 05:06.764
when the married couple
stand before you now?

05:08.016 --> 05:09.600
Because no one believes you.

05:09.684 --> 05:12.270
If you two can produce
a witness to verify your marriage,

05:12.353 --> 05:13.604
then you'll have our blessings.

05:13.688 --> 05:15.064
But if you can't,

05:15.148 --> 05:18.026
Jang Uk, you have no right
to take the heir of Jinyowon,

05:18.735 --> 05:19.902
and you'll have to go alone.

05:22.030 --> 05:24.490
As always, I see
you're picking fights over justification.

05:28.411 --> 05:30.121
If my powers are my justification,

05:31.831 --> 05:34.751
would you dare to even pick it apart?

05:43.676 --> 05:45.261
It seems that you have no proof.

05:48.514 --> 05:49.599
We can prove it to you now.

06:08.409 --> 06:09.243
We even…

06:10.787 --> 06:11.704
brought our witness here.

06:22.965 --> 06:23.800
They're right here.

06:33.434 --> 06:34.685
She's pregnant?

06:42.151 --> 06:43.986
So Bu-yeon's with child?

06:44.737 --> 06:45.738
Will this do

06:46.322 --> 06:47.990
as a witness you cannot deny…

06:49.826 --> 06:50.660
for our marriage?

06:50.743 --> 06:52.787
How can we believe you, huh?

06:53.830 --> 06:55.206
There's a physician here.

06:55.289 --> 06:57.583
Master Heo, please examine her.

06:57.667 --> 07:01.712
Well, I, uh… I can only tell
if it's been 21 days.

07:01.796 --> 07:06.134
Uk, when, uh…
uh, when were you two last together?

07:07.635 --> 07:10.304
How could you even ask such a thing?

07:10.388 --> 07:11.973
Oh, this old man has no shame!

07:12.056 --> 07:13.599
We have to be sure.

07:15.226 --> 07:16.561
Uh, Lady Jin.

07:17.186 --> 07:20.148
Hmm, uh, since it has come to this,

07:20.231 --> 07:22.358
can't we all agree to let her go with him?

07:23.067 --> 07:25.862
Marriage is meant to be
an affair kept in the family.

07:25.945 --> 07:29.115
The Unanimous Assembly
have no reason to discuss this further.

07:29.198 --> 07:31.951
Let's conclude this, yeah? Good! Go, go!

07:58.186 --> 08:01.147
Hey, Uk, were you at the meeting too?

08:04.484 --> 08:06.944
Bu-yeon, where are you going?

08:07.528 --> 08:08.863
I have gotten married to that man.

08:10.239 --> 08:12.533
So from now on,
I'll be living with my husband.

08:12.617 --> 08:13.534
Husband?

08:14.118 --> 08:17.455
You remember? I told you
I was waiting for my groom to come.

08:18.915 --> 08:21.792
He came for me so I'm going with him.

08:30.384 --> 08:31.969
So Jang Uk was the one…

08:33.304 --> 08:35.264
who got her out of that room then.

08:36.182 --> 08:39.393
Did your… uh, your sister just say

08:40.311 --> 08:42.271
that she and Jang Uk got married now?

08:45.233 --> 08:46.234
Oh.

08:53.032 --> 08:56.452
If Jang Uk is now
the Jin family's son-in-law,

08:56.536 --> 08:59.872
I see no reason
that Jinyowon would go to another family.

08:59.956 --> 09:02.750
I agree. With Jang Uk as their son-in-law,

09:02.833 --> 09:04.919
who would dare attack Jinyowon now?

09:05.002 --> 09:06.003
Ho-gyeong.

09:07.547 --> 09:10.591
You put on quite the show to introduce
Jin Bu-yeon to the rest of the world.

09:11.259 --> 09:13.719
In any case,
thanks to your incredible son-in-law,

09:14.345 --> 09:18.015
Jinyowon will remain protected for now.

09:29.819 --> 09:31.946
- Welcome, Young Master Jang.
- Mm-hm.

09:33.239 --> 09:35.366
Young Lady Jin, you returned?

09:36.242 --> 09:37.743
Yes, I did.

09:40.121 --> 09:41.330
Young Master.

09:41.414 --> 09:43.416
Where did you go without saying a word?

09:44.458 --> 09:47.295
- Oh, why's the Young Lady back--
- Maid Kim.

09:47.962 --> 09:49.589
She must be exhausted after tonight,

09:49.672 --> 09:51.799
so please, go prepare
a room for her to rest.

09:55.803 --> 09:59.682
I see that you're now dressed
as a proper lady of the Jin family today.

09:59.765 --> 10:01.142
That's because I was

10:01.225 --> 10:02.310
at the Unanimous Assembly.

10:02.393 --> 10:03.436
You said where?

10:04.687 --> 10:06.647
Wait! Hold on! Did he…

10:06.731 --> 10:09.025
Did the Young Master bring you
straight here from there?

10:10.484 --> 10:14.196
Yes. This time, I truly have come
to live in his house with him.

10:15.448 --> 10:17.366
I hope we can get along well,
Maidservant Kim.

10:17.992 --> 10:19.035
Of course.

10:21.412 --> 10:24.707
So it was Uk that Bu-yeon said
she'd given her heart to.

10:24.790 --> 10:25.625
Then…

10:26.667 --> 10:28.586
does this mean they're together now?

10:28.669 --> 10:30.755
When would they have even met?

10:30.838 --> 10:32.048
Oh, wait, hold on!

10:32.131 --> 10:34.383
It must have been
when Uk went into Jinyowon.

10:35.384 --> 10:38.804
Although, has it been 21 days since then?

10:39.930 --> 10:41.974
- 21?
- Never mind, Yul.

10:42.933 --> 10:44.518
Wow, can that be true?

10:52.610 --> 10:54.528
- But hey, Dang-gu.
- Huh?

10:55.112 --> 10:56.238
Do you really believe it?

10:57.531 --> 10:59.283
That Uk has truly forgotten her…

11:01.619 --> 11:03.287
and has actually given
his heart to this woman?

11:07.333 --> 11:08.668
Of course I don't.

11:10.544 --> 11:11.379
He couldn't have.

11:12.838 --> 11:15.007
I'm sure he has
a different reason for this.

11:19.679 --> 11:20.638
So why?

11:40.366 --> 11:41.992
A Jinyowon relic.

11:42.785 --> 11:46.205
Thanks to you, I was able
to finally get married to him.

11:49.375 --> 11:50.418
Wait a second…

11:55.256 --> 11:57.466
So did I really turn it off? Or did…

11:59.093 --> 12:00.469
Jang Uk turned it off for me

12:01.387 --> 12:02.555
so he could take me with?

12:05.683 --> 12:07.268
There's no way he would.

12:10.604 --> 12:12.982
If I did it, I should be able
to turn it back on.

12:40.176 --> 12:42.344
This is the sword that Uk carries.

12:44.555 --> 12:45.556
So beautiful!

13:01.572 --> 13:02.573
What happened?

13:05.785 --> 13:06.827
Did…

13:08.204 --> 13:09.246
you turn that on?

13:11.791 --> 13:13.083
Did you really do this?

13:14.752 --> 13:16.170
I mean, there's no one here but me,

13:17.755 --> 13:19.006
so then I must have…

13:19.089 --> 13:21.467
What does "I must have" mean?
Why not "I did it"?

13:22.510 --> 13:24.428
I keep seeing these images
flashing in my head,

13:24.512 --> 13:26.931
I think they must be memories
that I had forgotten.

13:27.932 --> 13:31.018
They told me that I would regain
my memories as my powers return.

13:33.395 --> 13:34.271
Do it again.

13:48.369 --> 13:50.538
Look! Right there! Look, I did it again!

13:50.621 --> 13:51.914
Well done!

13:51.997 --> 13:54.875
I couldn't recover any memories
while I was in prison.

13:54.959 --> 13:56.710
See! But now that I'm free

13:56.794 --> 13:59.547
and I'm in a new environment,
it's coming back to me.

14:00.130 --> 14:03.133
If you regain your memories like this,
your divine powers will return.

14:03.926 --> 14:04.969
I'm glad I brought you with me.

14:07.179 --> 14:08.264
Thank goodness.

14:09.139 --> 14:12.351
I was a little worried
because it seemed like you were angry.

14:12.434 --> 14:14.186
That was because you went up
and made up a witness

14:14.270 --> 14:15.271
who doesn't even exist.

14:17.481 --> 14:19.483
Oh, so you're not upset
because of my mother then?

14:21.318 --> 14:22.278
It's because of our child?

14:23.112 --> 14:25.823
We got out of that situation
because this baby was our witness.

14:26.407 --> 14:29.243
I was already expecting your mother
to react exactly the way she did.

14:29.326 --> 14:30.244
And for that baby…

14:35.958 --> 14:37.418
The way we keep talking about it
makes me think

14:37.501 --> 14:38.878
there's really something in there, ugh.

14:39.670 --> 14:40.671
So what do we do?

14:41.922 --> 14:42.965
That physician, Heo Yeom,

14:43.048 --> 14:45.634
wants to examine me
after 21 days have passed.

14:46.218 --> 14:47.511
I can't say there's no baby.

14:47.595 --> 14:50.222
Okay, then what?
We should make a baby before then?

15:03.319 --> 15:05.362
What? No!

15:12.578 --> 15:13.746
To tell you the truth,

15:14.705 --> 15:15.539
I was hoping that…

15:16.332 --> 15:18.959
you were the one who put out the light
at the Unanimous Assembly,

15:19.043 --> 15:20.836
and even though you didn't need me…

15:23.797 --> 15:25.299
you still chose to take me with.

15:28.260 --> 15:29.970
Even if it was me who did that,

15:30.804 --> 15:32.890
you really should know
it wasn't for the reason you were…

15:34.350 --> 15:35.184
hoping for.

15:41.148 --> 15:42.775
So what do you wanna do about this?

15:42.858 --> 15:46.904
Well, if you want, I can help you create
a witness to bring forth to Sejukwon

15:46.987 --> 15:47.988
within 21 days.

15:49.114 --> 15:51.825
Just as long as you don't continue
to hope like that.

16:21.772 --> 16:25.150
Let's say that our witness
was created together

16:26.068 --> 16:27.277
since we're married, after all.

16:28.445 --> 16:29.989
I can't say I made it all on my own.

16:31.991 --> 16:32.908
You said you would help.

16:34.576 --> 16:35.577
Don't resent me.

16:37.413 --> 16:39.123
Are you gonna keep lying
that this witness exists?

16:42.418 --> 16:43.877
What's wrong now?

16:44.503 --> 16:45.879
Stop acting so erratically.

16:52.761 --> 16:54.596
- What is it?
- Don't mind me.

17:02.563 --> 17:05.441
- What is this?
- She sewed the tracking thread into me.

17:06.608 --> 17:07.568
The one you broke, remember?

17:09.028 --> 17:10.779
And it hurts
because the thread's getting tighter.

17:11.697 --> 17:12.656
It seems that…

17:14.908 --> 17:16.535
mother is calling for me to return.

17:34.928 --> 17:37.222
I cannot allow you to stay with that man.

17:38.932 --> 17:39.850
You'll be back,

17:40.976 --> 17:42.061
my sweet Bu-yeon.

17:58.660 --> 18:00.329
Regardless of what's going on,

18:01.121 --> 18:03.332
how could a mother do something like this?

18:06.543 --> 18:09.463
Oh, dear, you must be
in excruciating pain.

18:10.547 --> 18:12.216
I think you should return back home.

18:12.299 --> 18:14.593
I'll tell the young master
to escort you there.

18:16.386 --> 18:17.513
Please don't do that!

18:18.430 --> 18:19.973
I told him that I would deal with it.

18:21.308 --> 18:22.601
Please do not ask him to send me back.

18:22.684 --> 18:25.187
But you're in
so much pain now, Young Lady.

18:27.272 --> 18:29.149
If I'm unable to endure this pain,

18:30.234 --> 18:32.069
then I do not deserve to take…

18:34.029 --> 18:35.072
what I truly desire.

18:38.408 --> 18:40.160
The pain that does not kill me now…

18:41.745 --> 18:42.579
eventually…

18:45.874 --> 18:47.209
I know will set me free.

18:59.304 --> 19:02.266
Young Master.
Young Lady Bu-yeon is in great pain.

19:02.349 --> 19:03.183
And so what?

19:03.934 --> 19:04.768
She wants to go back?

19:04.852 --> 19:06.311
No, she refused that.

19:06.395 --> 19:08.981
I applied some ointment for her,
but she's still in agony.

19:12.901 --> 19:14.319
She said that she could bear it.

19:15.237 --> 19:16.238
Just apply more ointment.

19:20.576 --> 19:22.536
He's the one who brought the girl here.

19:23.078 --> 19:24.496
How could he be so cold?

19:32.629 --> 19:35.382
Mother, stop! Please make it stop!

19:39.803 --> 19:41.513
Make it stop!

20:14.713 --> 20:17.341
Her face was identical to Naksu's,

20:17.424 --> 20:19.885
except her build and aura
were quite different.

20:21.303 --> 20:23.180
Naksu was never that small and slender.

20:25.307 --> 20:27.851
I need to find out
whatever I can about Jin Bu-yeon.

20:29.728 --> 20:30.771
So-i comes for her medicine

20:30.854 --> 20:32.731
- around now, right?
- Yeah.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.903
I need that girl.

20:55.629 --> 20:57.005
93.

20:57.506 --> 20:58.715
94.

20:59.716 --> 21:01.051
95.

21:02.135 --> 21:03.178
96.

21:04.805 --> 21:06.598
97.

21:07.224 --> 21:08.642
98.

21:09.559 --> 21:10.519
99.

21:11.186 --> 21:12.854
Now.

21:12.938 --> 21:14.856
Sang-gu, are you okay?

21:15.524 --> 21:16.358
Oh, my goodness.

21:16.984 --> 21:19.152
Do you want your little brother
to stay safe and sound?

21:20.946 --> 21:22.281
Then pay me what you owe.

21:24.449 --> 21:27.035
You said you sold your land.
Where's the money from that?

21:27.119 --> 21:29.246
I don't have any left. I've used it all.

21:30.080 --> 21:30.998
Is that so?

21:32.165 --> 21:33.375
Think carefully about that.

21:33.458 --> 21:35.127
Otherwise,
I'll count to 200 this time.

21:36.670 --> 21:37.754
Dunk him.

21:37.838 --> 21:39.923
No! Sang-gu! Sang-gu! Please!

21:40.007 --> 21:41.300
Two.

21:41.925 --> 21:42.759
- Three.
- Oh! Sang-gu! Please!

21:42.843 --> 21:44.136
- Madam.
- Four.

21:45.929 --> 21:46.847
And five.

21:48.640 --> 21:49.599
And six.

21:51.476 --> 21:52.352
Seven.

21:54.771 --> 21:55.814
And eight.

21:58.108 --> 21:58.942
Nine.

22:00.652 --> 22:01.486
Ten.

22:19.379 --> 22:20.255
Bu-yeon, please.

22:21.715 --> 22:23.467
Why are you making me hurt you?

22:24.343 --> 22:25.177
Come back to me.

22:41.693 --> 22:42.736
What did you just do?

22:45.280 --> 22:47.157
It's impossible for my wife to sleep.

22:48.408 --> 22:50.369
Please show some courtesy
and refrain from calling your daughter

22:50.452 --> 22:51.620
in the middle of the night.

22:51.703 --> 22:52.746
As you may know,

22:54.164 --> 22:55.999
the two of us haven't been married
for very long.

24:11.950 --> 24:13.368
It doesn't hurt.

24:16.788 --> 24:18.790
Mother must have given up calling for now.

24:26.298 --> 24:27.549
In return for the medicine…

24:30.427 --> 24:31.636
he wants you to bring her to him.

24:33.221 --> 24:34.222
Jin Bu-yeon?

24:34.931 --> 24:36.475
Jinyowon's next heir?

24:39.853 --> 24:41.021
But is this girl really her?

24:41.104 --> 24:42.147
Don't be clever!

24:42.230 --> 24:44.858
All you need is to do exactly
what the Gwanju ordered you to.

24:46.151 --> 24:48.778
The only reason that you're still alive
despite that blood parasite

24:48.862 --> 24:51.114
is because of the medicine
the Gwanju bestows upon you.

24:54.201 --> 24:57.245
Have I ever done anything
other than what's been asked of me?

24:58.413 --> 25:00.248
I'll bring her
to that chamber in Cheonbugwan.

25:12.469 --> 25:14.804
Have you told the person
who has been giving me this medicine

25:14.888 --> 25:16.306
that I wish to meet them?

25:17.349 --> 25:20.060
They refused,
said there is no need to meet you.

25:21.603 --> 25:24.731
But I have discovered more
about who this person really is.

25:25.857 --> 25:28.026
Is this someone named So-i?

25:28.944 --> 25:30.278
I knew it. You know each other then.

25:31.530 --> 25:34.950
That woman is the actual owner
of a notorious gambling den.

25:35.033 --> 25:36.743
Cheonbugwan is
behind her illegal business,

25:36.826 --> 25:38.245
according to the rumors.

25:39.454 --> 25:41.998
I don't really feel comfortable
giving you this medicine

25:42.499 --> 25:44.543
knowing that it came from such a woman.

25:45.669 --> 25:47.128
Where can I find this gambling den?

25:47.212 --> 25:48.547
It's in Gaema Village, Young Master.

25:49.381 --> 25:50.340
But that medicine,

25:50.423 --> 25:52.968
are you forced to take it
because of some illness?

25:53.051 --> 25:56.179
Is that why you're staying here
instead of Songrim, so you can hide it?

25:56.763 --> 25:57.597
That's not why.

25:58.473 --> 26:01.726
I'm simply more comfortable here.
You have nothing to worry about.

26:09.985 --> 26:10.860
Young Master.

26:12.445 --> 26:13.530
Did you just go somewhere?

26:13.613 --> 26:15.907
What is wrong?
Why are you still up at this hour?

26:15.991 --> 26:17.450
How could I rest now?

26:19.035 --> 26:21.913
You want me to stay up and just worry?

26:22.664 --> 26:23.582
Oh…

26:26.042 --> 26:26.876
Maidservant Kim.

26:28.169 --> 26:29.671
I'm sorry for getting married
without a word.

26:29.754 --> 26:31.339
I should have asked
for your permission first.

26:31.423 --> 26:34.175
If you were truly sorry,
you would be having a nice wedding.

26:34.259 --> 26:37.262
Until then, I won't consider her
the lady of this house.

26:37.345 --> 26:39.889
And I won't be calling you
"my lord" either, okay?

26:40.557 --> 26:43.268
Fine. Then prepare for a wedding.

26:48.064 --> 26:48.940
Do you mean it?

26:49.941 --> 26:52.402
But not my wedding though.
Prepare your wedding.

26:52.986 --> 26:55.322
- What do--
- I told you I already got married.

26:56.156 --> 26:58.700
So you can move out now and be with him.

27:00.410 --> 27:01.286
Now you can do that.

27:01.369 --> 27:02.912
What will you do if I go

27:03.955 --> 27:05.123
and get married to Lord Park?

27:05.206 --> 27:07.292
Bu-yeon and I are both gonna get
what we want.

27:07.375 --> 27:09.961
She says that they hid her
so no one knew she existed.

27:11.254 --> 27:12.714
This way, Bu-yeon can be free now.

27:14.341 --> 27:15.300
And I know I will be too.

27:15.383 --> 27:17.844
Should I understand
you're doing this to let go of…

27:19.137 --> 27:20.555
what happened to you back then?

27:27.270 --> 27:30.482
I'm going to say what I…
I've meant to say.

27:35.070 --> 27:37.739
That red egg-shaped stone
where you keep your heart,

27:39.658 --> 27:41.201
you must get rid of it.

27:42.827 --> 27:44.913
Why are you still holding on
to the yin-yang jade,

27:44.996 --> 27:46.456
when you shared it with that dead woman?

27:46.539 --> 27:47.749
You know it's known…

27:48.583 --> 27:50.168
for calling the one you shared it with.

27:52.504 --> 27:53.338
I am…

27:54.297 --> 27:56.841
so afraid that one day,
that dead woman will call for you…

27:58.301 --> 27:59.594
and take you with her.

28:15.652 --> 28:16.486
Don't worry.

28:17.070 --> 28:17.987
She's never once…

28:19.447 --> 28:21.032
called me using this jade.

28:23.326 --> 28:24.619
That girl is dead.

28:25.245 --> 28:28.415
That thing that hatched out
of that egg you nurtured…

28:28.998 --> 28:31.042
was nothing more
than a vicious bird of prey.

28:32.210 --> 28:34.963
And they dealt the horrific wound
to the person who nurtured it

28:35.046 --> 28:36.172
before they died.

28:36.256 --> 28:37.173
So, please…

28:38.299 --> 28:39.676
just destroy the stone.

28:41.136 --> 28:42.762
The reason I'm still holding this…

28:44.556 --> 28:46.516
is that I have to be certain
she's still dead.

28:48.727 --> 28:50.937
The only way I'll believe
she really is dead…

28:52.689 --> 28:54.399
is if I'm able to see it with my own eyes.

28:57.026 --> 28:57.861
Because…

28:59.362 --> 29:01.364
I never really witnessed her death myself.

29:12.834 --> 29:14.627
Who are they saying is dead?

29:15.670 --> 29:16.588
A bird?

29:26.014 --> 29:28.349
Now that it doesn't hurt,
I can sleep in peace.

29:34.564 --> 29:36.775
Should I tell him it doesn't hurt anymore?

29:37.358 --> 29:38.985
I hope that he isn't really worried.

30:05.762 --> 30:07.347
He'd never be worried about me.

30:24.489 --> 30:25.406
Young Lady.

30:26.157 --> 30:28.910
These people here are like family
to the Young Master.

30:30.203 --> 30:32.747
I'm the Jin family's eldest daughter,
Jin Bu-yeon.

30:33.748 --> 30:34.582
Nice to meet you.

30:36.793 --> 30:40.213
Is it really true
that you and Uk are married?

30:40.296 --> 30:42.090
This is why she came here to meet us.

30:43.132 --> 30:46.177
In any case, now that you two are married,
I congratulate you both.

30:46.261 --> 30:48.972
Not yet! Well, of course,
they'll have a wedding

30:49.055 --> 30:50.056
to make it official.

30:50.139 --> 30:55.520
Until that day, she's the heir to Jinyowon
and remains betrothed to the Young Master.

30:55.603 --> 30:58.690
Since she's adamant
on only calling you his betrothed,

30:58.773 --> 31:00.733
you must have lied about the baby too.

31:01.734 --> 31:02.902
My apologies.

31:02.986 --> 31:05.071
I thought a fight would break out
so I had to lie.

31:05.154 --> 31:06.948
Goodness. You're bold, aren't you?

31:10.034 --> 31:13.705
Have I… Have I ever seen you
for treatment before, Young Lady?

31:13.788 --> 31:14.956
I feel like I've seen you.

31:15.039 --> 31:16.291
I don't believe so.

31:16.833 --> 31:18.918
They told me I was treated
by the best physician

31:19.002 --> 31:20.503
that Daeho Fortress has to offer.

31:20.587 --> 31:22.463
I'm the best physician in Daeho Fortress.

31:22.547 --> 31:24.549
Who else is there? Give me their name.

31:24.632 --> 31:27.093
Uh, come on,
Master Heo, that's enough.

31:27.176 --> 31:29.053
She was never allowed to leave Jinyowon.

31:29.804 --> 31:32.265
What I heard,
she also suffers from memory loss.

31:33.600 --> 31:35.018
You've lost some of your memories?

31:36.477 --> 31:39.355
After I woke from an illness,
I had no memories at all.

31:39.439 --> 31:40.481
With that said,

31:40.565 --> 31:42.775
I'm still able to see energy,
the same way I could,

31:42.859 --> 31:43.985
like when I was a child.

31:46.404 --> 31:49.073
I can see that there's
a great energy within you two.

31:50.366 --> 31:54.245
You are one of the few mages I've met
with exceptionally strong powers.

31:54.329 --> 31:57.081
You can tell that
just by taking a look at us?

31:57.916 --> 32:01.544
As for you though,
your energy may not be as strong,

32:02.170 --> 32:04.255
but it shines so bright with purity.

32:04.339 --> 32:06.799
Everyone knows
Dang-gu has a great personality.

32:06.883 --> 32:09.344
That's what you call an ability?
Whatever. Come on!

32:09.427 --> 32:13.640
Your energy reminds me of my little sister
since it's so very clear and light.

32:14.515 --> 32:17.060
You must have heard then,
all about me from my sister.

32:17.143 --> 32:18.519
Uh…

32:18.603 --> 32:21.064
Are you and Jin Cho-yeon together again?

32:21.147 --> 32:23.441
- Well… no, no, we're not.
- He's not.

32:24.442 --> 32:26.778
- We only met to talk about Bu-yeon--
- Dang-gu.

32:26.861 --> 32:28.196
- You met her?
- What?

32:29.072 --> 32:29.948
Uh, I-I did.

32:30.031 --> 32:34.452
And I've also been sensing the energy
of two other people from over there.

32:34.535 --> 32:36.371
Whose energy
are you talking about right now?

32:36.454 --> 32:38.998
Come on! If anyone's there, come out.

32:48.174 --> 32:49.592
Ugh, why is she…

32:49.676 --> 32:51.010
What are you two doing over there?

33:01.521 --> 33:05.525
So what did you see in Jang Uk then?

33:06.234 --> 33:07.986
He had the energy of the sky within him.

33:08.736 --> 33:09.570
That's right.

33:10.405 --> 33:13.324
Uk had died once but then was revived

33:14.033 --> 33:15.201
because of that energy.

33:18.162 --> 33:19.330
So I was told.

33:20.373 --> 33:22.291
Since I have the power to see his energy,

33:22.917 --> 33:25.169
I'll make sure
I stay by his side and protect him.

33:29.549 --> 33:32.010
What do you think about Bu-yeon, my lord?

33:32.093 --> 33:35.388
She does appear to be
a great priestess with a unique power.

33:35.471 --> 33:37.932
But it seems like
she married our young master

33:38.433 --> 33:39.934
because she wants to leave Jinyowon.

33:41.436 --> 33:43.521
Even Young Master Jang…

33:44.856 --> 33:46.816
said he was only getting married
for my sake.

33:48.109 --> 33:49.819
He's getting married for your sake?

33:49.902 --> 33:52.989
He's trying to use it
as a way to let me know that I can stop…

33:53.072 --> 33:54.866
…worrying about him now.

33:58.995 --> 34:00.413
You do know what this means, right?

34:05.334 --> 34:07.462
I'll always be ready with open arms

34:08.004 --> 34:10.548
for the moment you know
you can come to me, Maid Kim.

34:20.224 --> 34:24.062
But it seems that there's something
still troubling your heart right now.

34:25.521 --> 34:26.939
There's no need to rush.

34:27.023 --> 34:29.859
I won't force you to come to me
if you aren't ready.

34:31.152 --> 34:34.530
And yet, my heart is beating so fast now.

34:34.614 --> 34:35.865
And mine as well.

34:37.075 --> 34:41.412
I may tell you it's okay but I can't hide
how much I wish to hold you.

34:51.214 --> 34:52.048
I…

34:52.548 --> 34:54.383
have my own desires like you.

35:03.392 --> 35:07.063
Master Heo doesn't seem
very fond of the Young Lady yet.

35:08.022 --> 35:10.024
Saying she looked familiar
just to pick a fight.

35:10.608 --> 35:14.070
Actually, I thought the same.
Something about her seemed familiar.

35:14.153 --> 35:15.822
I feel like I've seen her somewhere else.

35:16.614 --> 35:17.740
Is that so?

35:18.407 --> 35:20.409
You knew that dress from a single glance.

35:20.493 --> 35:23.371
Yeah, right! I know
I've seen her somewhere before.

35:23.454 --> 35:24.330
Of course you have.

35:25.414 --> 35:26.749
That dress that she had on

35:27.333 --> 35:30.461
was the one that Madam Do-hwa
used to wear often before she was married.

35:30.545 --> 35:32.547
Ah! That's right.

35:32.630 --> 35:34.090
That's why she looked so familiar to me.

35:34.924 --> 35:37.718
Back then, I'd written Do-hwa
a beautiful poem

35:37.802 --> 35:39.554
just after I saw her in that same dress.

35:47.687 --> 35:49.480
So this is the power of your first love.

35:49.564 --> 35:53.109
A man who can't take a hint
but knows his first love right away.

35:54.193 --> 35:56.154
- You must have been happy.
- Maid Kim, look at me.

35:57.405 --> 36:00.908
This heart is racing only because of you.

36:00.992 --> 36:01.951
Too late now.

36:08.833 --> 36:09.917
Listen carefully.

36:11.085 --> 36:13.212
Can you hear my heart?

36:16.757 --> 36:17.758
I can hear well.

36:19.010 --> 36:20.344
I was only teasing you.

36:20.928 --> 36:21.971
You can let go now.

36:26.392 --> 36:27.935
You're finally in my arms.

36:28.769 --> 36:30.688
I can't let you go now.

36:47.079 --> 36:48.664
I really don't need you to walk me home.

36:48.748 --> 36:51.042
I may have lost my memory,
but I am not helpless.

36:51.709 --> 36:53.711
Uh, please don't misunderstand.

36:53.794 --> 36:56.088
She only told us
because she was concerned for you.

36:56.172 --> 36:58.633
She's having a hard time
coming to terms with you marrying Uk.

36:58.716 --> 37:01.010
To be honest, it's hard for me too.

37:02.094 --> 37:04.555
She asked me
to keep an eye out for you, Bu-yeon.

37:04.639 --> 37:06.432
Cho-yeon couldn't really defend me

37:06.515 --> 37:08.476
because she was too afraid
of my mother but…

37:09.644 --> 37:11.854
- I know she is pure and kind-hearted.
- Mm.

37:13.606 --> 37:15.233
Um, is your wound

37:15.316 --> 37:16.692
from the tracking thread
healing all right?

37:17.693 --> 37:20.154
She said she was relieved
that it won't be hurting you anymore.

37:20.238 --> 37:24.242
Do you think Cho-yeon secretly hid
the spool of tracking thread somewhere

37:24.951 --> 37:26.244
so Mother cannot use it anymore?

37:28.996 --> 37:30.665
Is that why the pain suddenly stopped?

37:30.748 --> 37:31.582
What?

37:33.125 --> 37:36.671
Then you don't know? No one told you
anything about what happened last night?

37:37.922 --> 37:38.881
What happened last night?

37:38.965 --> 37:40.299
The spool was destroyed.

37:41.050 --> 37:43.511
Uk stormed into Jinyowon
in the middle of the night

37:43.594 --> 37:44.553
and shattered it.

37:49.475 --> 37:51.269
Hmm, I heard because of him,

37:52.270 --> 37:54.522
Jinyowon was in utter chaos last night.

37:54.605 --> 37:56.941
Did you really not know any of this?

37:57.900 --> 37:58.901
I really didn't know.

38:00.027 --> 38:00.861
He…

38:03.447 --> 38:04.532
told me to just bear it.

38:05.116 --> 38:06.033
Hmm.

38:22.925 --> 38:25.094
During the day,
Uk often goes to the Dark Forest,

38:25.177 --> 38:28.889
which gets its name from how dense
the cypress trees grow in there.

38:33.436 --> 38:36.605
Deep within the forest,
you can find some stone towers.

38:36.689 --> 38:38.774
Every single one of those towers
was stacked by Uk,

38:39.317 --> 38:40.985
one for every soul shifter he's killed.

38:41.068 --> 38:43.154
He's turned it
into some kind of graveyard.

38:44.530 --> 38:47.283
Everyone in Daeho was too scared
to get anywhere close.

38:47.950 --> 38:50.703
But Uk seems to prefer it

38:51.287 --> 38:52.872
as he goes there quite often.

39:20.775 --> 39:23.319
He said that he'd be here but he's not.

39:24.653 --> 39:26.947
Do all of these graves
belong to soul shifters?

39:38.167 --> 39:39.043
Oh…

39:40.294 --> 39:41.253
Right…

39:42.713 --> 39:43.923
one of those is hers.

39:46.592 --> 39:47.843
I guess she'll see it.

39:55.351 --> 39:57.061
Then you found and killed
that soul shifter, right?

39:58.604 --> 39:59.438
She died.

40:00.314 --> 40:02.650
The grave of the soul shifter
he mentioned before…

40:04.610 --> 40:05.986
must be here then.

40:10.741 --> 40:13.285
- Bird's eggs.
- We'll each keep one, okay?

40:14.954 --> 40:16.831
I pick red. You can have blue.

40:27.174 --> 40:29.009
I didn't even touch it.

40:30.428 --> 40:31.762
So why did this collapse?

40:59.999 --> 41:02.877
This is not an ordinary stone.

41:09.216 --> 41:11.177
In that memory, I saw this exact stone.

41:12.052 --> 41:13.554
Did this come from Jinyowon?

41:14.263 --> 41:15.890
Did I see this as a child?

41:23.731 --> 41:25.024
Who is this woman?

41:25.107 --> 41:28.277
Jin Bu-yeon was really Mu-deok,
and Mu-deok is already dead.

41:35.659 --> 41:37.286
If this is from Jinyowon,

41:38.245 --> 41:39.830
would Cho-yeon know about this?

41:49.798 --> 41:51.509
Hey! Stop right there!

41:54.428 --> 41:55.471
I said stop!

41:55.554 --> 41:57.306
Hey, watch out!

41:58.182 --> 41:59.350
- Oh!
- Oh, my…

41:59.433 --> 42:01.310
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

42:02.895 --> 42:03.938
I am sorry.

42:12.446 --> 42:14.740
Lure her toward Cheonbugwan's back door.

42:14.823 --> 42:16.659
Yeom-su will be waiting there.

42:16.742 --> 42:17.743
Yes, Madam.

42:17.826 --> 42:19.119
Once she lures her,

42:19.203 --> 42:21.539
Jin Bu-yeon will be brought
straight over here.

42:28.963 --> 42:31.924
After I read her mind
using this precious incense,

42:32.925 --> 42:37.137
I will know for certain
whether that girl really is Jin Bu-yeon.

42:56.240 --> 42:57.199
That's odd.

42:58.117 --> 42:59.994
The stone's energy is over there.

43:18.053 --> 43:20.431
How did she know to follow me over here?

43:57.593 --> 43:59.178
Seeing that you're hiding,
you must have noticed

43:59.261 --> 44:00.137
I've been following you.

44:12.316 --> 44:14.234
You must be wondering how I knew.

44:15.152 --> 44:16.820
I have the power to see energy.

44:17.988 --> 44:19.907
That means even if you're hiding,
I can see yours too.

44:20.741 --> 44:22.493
I can even see the stone's energy.

44:44.848 --> 44:45.724
I sense bad energy.

44:47.101 --> 44:48.394
I should not inhale any of this.

44:51.689 --> 44:52.898
She can see energy?

44:54.108 --> 44:56.193
Jin Bu-yeon's supposed to have
that kind of power.

44:57.152 --> 44:59.321
I'll wait until the soporific
makes her pass out,

45:00.364 --> 45:01.532
then take her to Cheonbugwan.

45:03.242 --> 45:04.952
- Please come again! Bye!
- Thank you!

45:08.497 --> 45:09.832
I'm here to see the owner.

45:11.625 --> 45:13.293
Go down there
and she'll be in the last room.

45:26.557 --> 45:28.100
Madam, I've been looking for you.

45:28.183 --> 45:29.476
Someone came to see you.

46:00.215 --> 46:01.258
It smells like soporifics.

46:20.360 --> 46:21.612
- Jin Bu-yeon?
- Oh…

46:25.824 --> 46:27.075
So what are you doing in here?

46:27.159 --> 46:30.120
I have been chasing this… this pickpocket.

46:30.204 --> 46:31.580
What are you doing here?

46:32.372 --> 46:33.624
I came here to see someone.

46:38.212 --> 46:39.296
Ugh! Gosh.

46:47.095 --> 46:47.930
Oh, gosh.

46:50.891 --> 46:51.850
Grab onto me.

46:53.227 --> 46:55.103
But you'll get as wet as me then.

46:56.271 --> 46:58.524
- That's all right.
- Why, thank you.

47:13.455 --> 47:14.456
Hang on, just wait!

47:23.924 --> 47:26.343
There was this gas everywhere,
so I jumped into the water.

47:28.762 --> 47:30.389
I thought I would drown in that tub.

47:41.483 --> 47:43.318
Uh, cover up, please.

47:43.902 --> 47:45.612
But I'm not cold.

47:50.158 --> 47:51.827
I must have looked mortifying, I assume.

47:56.456 --> 47:58.000
Thank you for this too.

48:01.295 --> 48:03.088
So would you like me to help you
catch your pickpocket?

48:03.171 --> 48:04.798
I got back what's mine.

48:04.882 --> 48:07.050
I don't want to cause a scene,
so I'll just go.

48:08.176 --> 48:10.220
Go on. Go meet
with whoever you came to see.

48:11.096 --> 48:13.181
I'm not in a rush,
so please allow me to walk with you.

48:13.891 --> 48:16.643
This neighborhood can be
very dangerous to walk in alone.

48:21.398 --> 48:22.900
This place is called Gaema Village.

48:23.859 --> 48:26.361
You can find many shamans
that practice fortune-telling here.

48:26.445 --> 48:27.446
There're some…

48:27.988 --> 48:29.907
who even practice sorcery in these parts.

48:31.158 --> 48:34.077
That must be why
the roads feel so dark and cold here.

48:34.161 --> 48:37.247
If you must come to a dangerous place
such as this, Uk should come with you.

48:38.582 --> 48:40.125
Do you know Jang Uk?

48:40.208 --> 48:41.710
How do you know each other if I may ask?

48:43.545 --> 48:45.714
Dang-gu, Uk, and I have been friends
since we were children.

48:45.797 --> 48:48.008
- Ah!
- For the past three years,

48:48.091 --> 48:50.552
I had to return to my hometown,
and only just recently came back.

48:50.636 --> 48:52.137
Dang-gu and I already met the other day.

48:52.220 --> 48:54.348
He's someone with very bright energy.

48:56.516 --> 48:57.601
And as for you…

49:07.819 --> 49:10.572
I'm a little jealous that you've had
such old friends though.

49:12.824 --> 49:14.076
Oh, and…

49:15.953 --> 49:18.497
I feel like we've been walking in circles
for a while now.

49:22.084 --> 49:24.962
Uh, I lose my sense of direction
when I get distracted.

49:25.045 --> 49:26.088
I'm very sorry.

49:29.049 --> 49:30.425
I think we should go that way.

49:33.637 --> 49:34.805
We already went that way.

49:37.015 --> 49:38.100
Let's go this way.

49:41.186 --> 49:44.606
We've walked here so many times,
I've memorized it. So just follow me.

49:51.738 --> 49:52.906
It's my fault for getting lost.

49:53.699 --> 49:54.533
I'm very sorry.

49:54.616 --> 49:55.909
That's all right though.

49:56.743 --> 49:57.869
Who cares if you're a little dumb.

49:59.621 --> 50:01.456
- Not when you're handsome.
- I just got flustered.

50:01.540 --> 50:03.041
No one thinks that I'm dumb!

50:03.875 --> 50:04.710
Yeah, sure.

50:05.711 --> 50:07.087
I don't think you're understanding me.

50:10.215 --> 50:12.968
I was always the top pupil
during my training in Jeongjingak,

50:13.051 --> 50:14.970
and I'd mastered every book.
They would even say

50:15.053 --> 50:16.805
if you don't know something, ask Seo Yul.

50:16.888 --> 50:18.223
I'm that Seo Yul, okay?

50:19.224 --> 50:20.100
Hmm.

50:21.893 --> 50:22.894
So you're actually smart?

50:24.813 --> 50:25.981
How very unfortunate!

50:29.526 --> 50:30.736
As you can see,

50:32.029 --> 50:33.530
my beauty is unmatched.

50:35.240 --> 50:36.491
But I'm not bright.

50:38.910 --> 50:42.289
With how foolish you seemed,
and since you're also handsome,

50:42.372 --> 50:43.707
I felt a sense of kinship.

50:45.333 --> 50:46.835
It's a shame you're smart, you know.

50:48.462 --> 50:49.588
If that's the case then,

50:50.422 --> 50:53.633
I can deem myself a fool too.
We can be two foolish friends.

50:55.761 --> 50:56.636
Well, then, thank you.

51:00.307 --> 51:03.560
Oh, there's something
I've been wondering about for a while.

51:05.062 --> 51:07.647
Was there a soul shifter
who regained their sight?

51:09.149 --> 51:12.861
Uk said he got close enough to be able
to see the blue mark in their eyes so…

51:14.029 --> 51:15.155
do you know who that was, Yul?

51:17.074 --> 51:18.992
That was a soul shifter known as Naksu.

51:19.076 --> 51:20.160
Naksu?

51:21.745 --> 51:22.913
I heard she had died.

51:24.164 --> 51:24.998
Yeah.

51:25.999 --> 51:27.959
Uk had also been murdered
at the hand of her blade.

51:28.752 --> 51:29.586
Ah.

51:32.881 --> 51:34.925
So Naksu was his enemy, I guess.

51:39.179 --> 51:40.889
So you really didn't know
about any of this?

51:42.224 --> 51:43.225
I didn't know.

51:45.560 --> 51:48.980
I guess I should be careful
not to mention her to Jang Uk.

51:53.777 --> 51:55.153
Thank you for letting me know.

52:14.798 --> 52:16.842
That girl has the ability to see energy?

52:18.468 --> 52:20.345
She must be the real Jin Bu-yeon then.

52:21.429 --> 52:22.305
Did you not…

52:22.931 --> 52:25.684
say you were the one who threw her
into the lake when she was a child?

52:25.767 --> 52:27.978
Aren't you worried
that people will find out about that?

52:30.147 --> 52:31.982
Her dead father pushed her.

52:33.650 --> 52:36.528
That poor blind girl has no idea
that I was even there.

52:36.611 --> 52:39.239
And because Naksu has murdered
Jin U-tak for you,

52:40.448 --> 52:41.825
there's nothing to worry about.

52:41.908 --> 52:43.785
And it's the reason you're still here.

52:46.163 --> 52:49.124
It's the reason
that you turned into a poor victim

52:49.749 --> 52:52.544
instead of being known
as a fraud who killed many

52:52.627 --> 52:55.964
and went as far as infesting themselves
a blood parasite

52:56.047 --> 52:58.008
in order to become their daughter.

53:00.385 --> 53:01.303
That is correct.

53:02.220 --> 53:05.515
I am forever indebted to you.

53:05.599 --> 53:07.434
I know that you don't really mean that.

53:08.351 --> 53:10.687
But as long as
that parasite remains inside you,

53:10.770 --> 53:12.647
you can never leave me.

53:13.190 --> 53:14.733
Because without the medicine I give you,

53:15.525 --> 53:18.945
you would die a painful death
as your insides melt together.

53:19.738 --> 53:23.325
Regardless, both you and I
and my organization

53:23.867 --> 53:26.536
were able to escape alive,
thanks to Naksu.

53:26.620 --> 53:29.539
Although, I can't believe
how much she resembles her.

53:31.917 --> 53:32.834
What do you mean?

53:32.918 --> 53:36.004
Jin Bu-yeon is practically
Naksu's spitting image.

53:36.838 --> 53:38.506
That's why I was wary.

53:39.216 --> 53:42.719
Regardless, seeing how
that girl indeed has divine powers,

53:42.802 --> 53:46.514
she must be the real heiress
to Jinyowon after all.

53:46.598 --> 53:48.266
So that woman truly is…

53:49.851 --> 53:51.144
Jin Bu-yeon, isn't she?

54:00.320 --> 54:04.074
There was a drought
but all these flowers look so fresh.

54:04.157 --> 54:06.201
These are the flowers you loved
when we were children.

54:06.284 --> 54:08.453
So I searched throughout Daeho
to find them.

54:08.536 --> 54:10.497
They're so bright and vibrant
because they're grown

54:10.580 --> 54:12.040
from the Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

54:21.258 --> 54:22.801
My old body used to be…

54:23.969 --> 54:25.470
just like this flower.

54:26.096 --> 54:29.307
As this flower is full of moisture,
it's fresh and beautiful.

54:29.808 --> 54:32.686
The flowers outside have too little energy

54:32.769 --> 54:34.396
and are rather unsightly.

54:34.479 --> 54:37.482
They're unsightly
because these flowers have no energy.

54:39.276 --> 54:40.610
They're like me.

54:46.283 --> 54:50.328
Argh! Even flowers manage to look fresh

54:50.412 --> 54:51.913
just by someone watering them!

54:52.998 --> 54:56.042
No matter how much energy I consume,

54:56.126 --> 54:58.670
my body can't stop rotting away!

55:01.715 --> 55:03.174
Do you want me to petrify?

55:04.217 --> 55:06.261
Trapped forever in this miserable body?

55:07.178 --> 55:10.140
How dare you mock me, huh?

55:13.476 --> 55:16.146
I'm so sorry, Your Highness!
Please have mercy!

55:16.813 --> 55:20.525
You, girl, are so fresh
and full of sweet vitality.

55:25.572 --> 55:29.117
Would you dear switch bodies with me, huh?

55:31.453 --> 55:34.706
Why would you wanna switch bodies
with a mere lady away from court?

55:34.789 --> 55:36.458
You are our noble Queen,

55:36.541 --> 55:37.375
after all.

55:47.761 --> 55:50.305
This is my cousin from Seoho Fortress.

55:51.348 --> 55:53.016
He almost married Jin Bu-yeon.

55:55.477 --> 55:56.895
I heard about what happened.

55:57.479 --> 56:00.440
Jang Uk's married into Jinyowon?

56:00.523 --> 56:01.608
And now,

56:02.525 --> 56:05.278
it'll be even more difficult
to take control of Jinyowon

56:06.154 --> 56:07.614
away from the Jin family.

56:09.699 --> 56:11.826
But the rite of the great lake?

56:11.910 --> 56:14.204
You said only a relic of Jinyowon

56:14.287 --> 56:16.498
had the power to take
the ice stone of the sky.

56:19.793 --> 56:24.339
How could we possibly open Jinyowon
if that man's there?

56:24.422 --> 56:27.342
We just need to separate
Jin Bu-yeon from Jang Uk.

56:27.425 --> 56:28.635
But they're a married couple now.

56:28.718 --> 56:31.805
Who would acknowledge her as his wife
when there wasn't even a wedding?

56:31.888 --> 56:33.139
And what's more,

56:33.223 --> 56:36.726
Jang Uk in fact has another bride
that everyone in Daeho knows about.

56:41.314 --> 56:42.148
Naksu?

56:42.232 --> 56:44.776
It'll soon be three years
ever since Naksu's death.

56:44.859 --> 56:47.362
I shall summon Naksu's soul once again.

56:47.445 --> 56:49.948
Jang Uk will be thrown into despair.

56:51.282 --> 56:52.200
Afterwards…

56:54.160 --> 56:58.581
Jin Bu-yeon can go on
and get married to her former betrothed.

57:07.298 --> 57:09.634
I heard none of the mages
at the Unanimous Assembly

57:09.717 --> 57:12.053
could stop Jang Uk
from leaving the Jinyowon's priestess.

57:12.137 --> 57:14.973
Is he truly more powerful
than all of the mages at the Assembly?

57:15.056 --> 57:17.308
I heard they just let him go
because he said they're married.

57:18.977 --> 57:20.645
They always have
a good excuse, don't they?

57:20.728 --> 57:23.857
I heard Jin Bu-yeon wields
great divine powers.

57:23.940 --> 57:25.775
Did he only marry her
because of those powers?

57:25.859 --> 57:29.446
Her portrait was posted all over Daeho
and apparently, she's a great beauty.

57:30.071 --> 57:31.156
He did it for her looks?

57:31.239 --> 57:33.241
I know Jang Uk pretty well at this point.

57:33.324 --> 57:35.076
He would only seduce a woman
because he needs her,

57:35.160 --> 57:36.703
not because of how she looks.

57:51.676 --> 57:52.802
Did they fight?

57:52.886 --> 57:54.846
Something must have happened
to the court ladies

57:54.929 --> 57:56.473
who're serving Her Royal Highness.

57:58.516 --> 58:00.393
It seems she's taking her anger
out on the innocent

58:00.477 --> 58:03.062
since His Majesty does
all he can to avoid her now.

58:03.146 --> 58:06.441
In fact, lately, there's been
some talk regarding the powder

58:06.524 --> 58:08.359
the Queen has given to her Ladies.

58:09.068 --> 58:09.903
Powder?

58:10.570 --> 58:12.655
Cosmetics? Like how?

58:12.739 --> 58:14.824
They say the powder that they were given

58:14.908 --> 58:17.577
seems to be cursed with sorcery
that dries out their skin.

58:21.664 --> 58:23.500
Retrieve all the powder
that she's given to them

58:24.042 --> 58:26.503
and look into where the Queen
would get such an item like that.

58:27.504 --> 58:28.671
Yes, Sire.

58:35.678 --> 58:37.555
Hey, come look at these beautiful shoes.

58:37.639 --> 58:39.849
Gosh, what a pretty lady!
Come look at these shoes.

58:39.933 --> 58:42.060
Come here, look. They suit you perfectly.

58:42.143 --> 58:44.646
- I bet they'll look great on you.
- Wow, beautiful!

58:44.729 --> 58:45.897
Oh, yes. Thank you.

58:45.980 --> 58:47.106
Come again!

58:50.818 --> 58:52.820
Wow! That looks delicious.

59:01.371 --> 59:03.915
Oh. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

59:15.677 --> 59:17.679
Is there anything you are looking for?

59:19.806 --> 59:22.183
I heard you're selling powder
directly to the royal palace.

59:22.267 --> 59:24.310
- What? A powder?
- Yeah.

59:28.189 --> 59:29.399
I'm a eunuch from the royal palace.

59:30.817 --> 59:32.944
You must be the eunuch
she sent to collect.

59:33.486 --> 59:35.029
This way, follow me.

59:45.873 --> 59:50.837
Oh, my! Interested in the rouge?
Go on! Try it on! It's so pretty.

59:50.920 --> 59:53.339
There's no need.
I'm just looking for now. Thank you.

59:54.549 --> 59:56.593
This isn't just any rouge.

59:56.676 --> 59:58.886
If you put this on your lips,

59:58.970 --> 01:00:02.181
you will have the power
to sway the hearts of men everywhere.

01:00:04.851 --> 01:00:05.685
Is that true?

01:00:06.519 --> 01:00:08.688
Are you attempting to seduce
a man you know?

01:00:10.857 --> 01:00:12.233
I have a husband.

01:00:12.942 --> 01:00:13.776
Ah…

01:00:20.199 --> 01:00:22.452
I can tell this rouge is no ordinary item.

01:00:22.535 --> 01:00:25.913
All of our products are
rather unique items.

01:00:26.748 --> 01:00:27.582
Just look.

01:00:27.665 --> 01:00:29.876
Do you see that eunuch
from the royal palace?

01:00:30.752 --> 01:00:34.213
Even the members
of the royal family shop here.

01:00:34.756 --> 01:00:36.132
I'm guessing you didn't know that.

01:00:36.215 --> 01:00:37.842
The energy here doesn't feel very good.

01:00:40.762 --> 01:00:43.806
The energy flowing through this shop
is similar to Gaema Village's.

01:00:44.641 --> 01:00:47.477
Oh, are you also a shaman then?

01:00:47.560 --> 01:00:50.063
I can show you
what usually peaks their interests.

01:00:50.855 --> 01:00:51.731
No, thank you.

01:00:56.486 --> 01:00:58.529
Are you selling this… this turtle too?

01:00:58.613 --> 01:01:01.824
I'm sorry but that's not for sale.
That's our special ingredient.

01:01:01.908 --> 01:01:03.076
Ingredient?

01:01:03.159 --> 01:01:06.204
The shell of a turtle is a vital resource.

01:01:06.287 --> 01:01:09.666
It's very precious.
Don't put your hands on it!

01:01:10.416 --> 01:01:12.251
- Ok-sim!
- What?

01:01:12.335 --> 01:01:14.837
An ingredient? You poor thing.

01:01:18.383 --> 01:01:21.302
Uh, excuse me, Mr. Eunuch,
do you have money?

01:01:24.472 --> 01:01:25.765
Me?

01:01:26.474 --> 01:01:29.102
- Were you just talking to me?
- If you have some, buy this turtle then.

01:01:30.019 --> 01:01:31.604
I can tell it has very good energy.

01:01:31.688 --> 01:01:33.147
If you keep it, it'll bring you luck.

01:01:34.857 --> 01:01:37.151
Do shamans read turtles' fortune as well?

01:01:37.235 --> 01:01:38.778
Why should I keep it?

01:01:38.861 --> 01:01:42.240
It will be killed if it remains here
much longer. Take pity on him.

01:01:42.323 --> 01:01:44.701
Forget it. If you pity it,
you should purchase it. Why would I?

01:01:44.784 --> 01:01:46.411
It's just I have no way to pay.

01:01:46.494 --> 01:01:48.162
And I'm living at someone else's home,

01:01:48.246 --> 01:01:49.956
so I wouldn't dare
to take it in, you know.

01:01:52.125 --> 01:01:53.042
Oh, how sweet!

01:01:53.584 --> 01:01:55.795
Look how it's stretching its neck
to look up at you.

01:01:55.878 --> 01:01:57.046
Will you just let it die here?

01:02:01.884 --> 01:02:04.303
All turtles look like that.
It's… it's not stretching

01:02:04.387 --> 01:02:05.972
just to… just to look up at me.

01:02:07.724 --> 01:02:09.809
Take it and raise it! I mean…

01:02:10.351 --> 01:02:12.562
if you are a eunuch,
you can't have children anyways.

01:02:13.646 --> 01:02:15.189
It will be very rewarding for you.

01:02:15.857 --> 01:02:18.067
Children?

01:02:19.068 --> 01:02:20.194
Listen, shaman.

01:02:20.278 --> 01:02:22.739
If you're this bad at reading,
it's no wonder you're broke.

01:02:22.822 --> 01:02:24.991
Do I look like the kind of guy
who would raise a turtle as his own?

01:02:25.575 --> 01:02:28.161
I'm not able to read faces,
but I can see energy.

01:02:28.244 --> 01:02:30.288
Although you may speak coldly towards me,

01:02:31.122 --> 01:02:34.125
your eyes reflect a warm heart
that wants to save this turtle.

01:02:37.920 --> 01:02:39.547
You have a very unique energy too.

01:02:40.465 --> 01:02:41.591
Maybe the palace gives it to you.

01:02:43.760 --> 01:02:45.720
Yes, I am…

01:02:47.680 --> 01:02:48.848
a member of the Go family.

01:02:54.562 --> 01:02:57.857
Okay then, Eunuch Go,
take good care of this turtle.

01:03:06.282 --> 01:03:08.034
By saying I was a member of the Go family,

01:03:08.117 --> 01:03:09.827
I told her I was royalty.

01:03:11.120 --> 01:03:12.705
How could she not know?

01:03:12.789 --> 01:03:14.248
Is she dumb?

01:03:18.419 --> 01:03:19.462
Your Highness.

01:03:20.171 --> 01:03:21.756
It was the same powder.

01:03:26.260 --> 01:03:30.056
The well was just fine, but in a few days,
it just suddenly dried up.

01:03:30.139 --> 01:03:32.809
Cheonbugwan was called to investigate
what was going on,

01:03:32.892 --> 01:03:34.977
but they have yet
to lift their hand to help.

01:03:35.061 --> 01:03:36.938
This drought's gone on for a while,

01:03:37.021 --> 01:03:39.190
but no well could have dried up
in a few days like this.

01:03:42.610 --> 01:03:44.195
Why did you bring someone like him here?

01:03:45.029 --> 01:03:47.365
Why didn't you bring
a powerful mage instead?

01:03:47.448 --> 01:03:50.493
Hey, he said he'd look into it
if I paid for his dinner.

01:03:50.576 --> 01:03:52.161
- How could I know he would be like this?
- Gosh!

01:04:15.476 --> 01:04:17.395
Oh, my! Oh! The well is filling up.

01:04:17.478 --> 01:04:19.021
Oh! What a relief!

01:04:19.105 --> 01:04:21.107
Oh! Oh, thank you so much!

01:04:21.190 --> 01:04:22.275
I can't believe it!

01:04:22.358 --> 01:04:25.278
I've already found similar things
in five other wells so far.

01:04:25.361 --> 01:04:26.654
Thank you so much!

01:04:27.613 --> 01:04:29.407
Who could be behind all of this?

01:04:33.953 --> 01:04:35.955
It's no celebration without noodles.

01:04:38.833 --> 01:04:40.293
You moron!

01:04:40.376 --> 01:04:42.503
Had you two had a proper wedding ceremony,

01:04:42.587 --> 01:04:45.923
you'd have had the chance to serve
all guests a helping of my noodles.

01:05:03.149 --> 01:05:05.818
I would never serve this to anyone.

01:05:05.902 --> 01:05:08.070
If you serve this at your wedding
to Maidservant Kim, I…

01:05:09.030 --> 01:05:09.947
I'll be very upset.

01:05:13.367 --> 01:05:14.201
Fine, I hear you.

01:05:18.331 --> 01:05:19.999
Do you think marrying Maid Kim off to me…

01:05:21.375 --> 01:05:22.251
would…

01:05:23.336 --> 01:05:25.713
mean you could just run off to die alone?

01:05:30.760 --> 01:05:33.220
Your new bride seems
to be unaware of this.

01:05:33.304 --> 01:05:34.889
How come you haven't told her yet?

01:05:34.972 --> 01:05:36.724
She's still missing her divine powers.

01:05:37.350 --> 01:05:40.519
When her memories return,
she says her powers will as well.

01:05:40.603 --> 01:05:41.562
And I've confirmed that.

01:05:43.230 --> 01:05:44.941
Then it won't happen anytime soon.

01:05:47.443 --> 01:05:48.277
Eat your noodles.

01:05:52.531 --> 01:05:54.951
These noodles, by the way,
I'm certain will kill me.

01:05:55.034 --> 01:05:58.579
Really? But I used the exact recipe
they taught me down in the kitchens.

01:05:59.121 --> 01:06:03.417
I guess Mu-deok used to enjoy
making those noodles.

01:06:05.962 --> 01:06:08.255
I have, since now, avoided saying her name

01:06:08.339 --> 01:06:10.466
because I had no desire to hurt you.

01:06:11.968 --> 01:06:12.802
But I…

01:06:13.886 --> 01:06:16.138
I think by not saying,
it never allowed you to heal.

01:06:20.643 --> 01:06:21.477
You…

01:06:22.979 --> 01:06:25.189
have yet to visit the cliff
where she died, right?

01:06:25.982 --> 01:06:29.443
So why did you build
that stone tower so deep in the forest?

01:06:29.527 --> 01:06:31.362
Was it not made to commemorate her death

01:06:31.445 --> 01:06:33.280
but rather as hope she'd return?

01:06:38.494 --> 01:06:39.370
Sang-ho…

01:06:41.956 --> 01:06:45.876
witnessed her petrified before she fell
into Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:06:49.088 --> 01:06:50.589
He'll tell you what he saw.

01:06:51.674 --> 01:06:52.717
Hear it for yourself.

01:06:54.760 --> 01:06:56.053
And then mourn for her.

01:06:56.929 --> 01:07:00.391
And if you still want to die after that…

01:07:05.062 --> 01:07:06.022
come back here.

01:07:07.940 --> 01:07:09.316
I will cook something for you…

01:07:10.776 --> 01:07:12.153
other than these noodles here.

01:08:06.290 --> 01:08:07.374
He's still not here.

01:08:16.592 --> 01:08:17.760
Jang Uk.

01:08:18.719 --> 01:08:19.845
Ah, goodness me.

01:08:21.263 --> 01:08:25.476
Young Master Jang is often away for days
on end without saying where he's going.

01:08:26.268 --> 01:08:28.104
You shouldn't await for him,
just go to bed.

01:08:50.084 --> 01:08:51.669
He still hasn't come home yet.

01:08:52.419 --> 01:08:53.462
When is he coming back?

01:09:01.554 --> 01:09:04.098
I wanted to say thanks
for destroying the tracking thread.

01:09:11.814 --> 01:09:14.108
I'm sure he'll be delighted
when I tell him I regained…

01:09:16.360 --> 01:09:17.820
another memory of mine.

01:09:40.759 --> 01:09:43.512
Just wait there.
I'll be there soon too.

01:09:44.013 --> 01:09:45.598
Make your next promise…

01:09:46.807 --> 01:09:48.225
to me right now, Young Master.

01:09:48.809 --> 01:09:49.977
You're the only one

01:09:50.060 --> 01:09:52.146
that I'll be wearing
for the rest of my life.

01:09:52.229 --> 01:09:54.231
If it's a life or death situation,

01:09:54.315 --> 01:09:56.317
give up love and live.

01:09:57.443 --> 01:09:58.777
This is an order from your master.

01:10:18.172 --> 01:10:19.423
Are you all finished eating?

01:10:28.432 --> 01:10:30.476
Why hasn't Jang Uk come home yet?

01:10:31.602 --> 01:10:32.645
My lady.

01:10:33.229 --> 01:10:34.396
You've been summoned to the study.

01:10:35.064 --> 01:10:36.565
Really?

01:10:38.567 --> 01:10:40.194
How many days have gone by?

01:10:40.277 --> 01:10:43.656
Uh… but it's not… young master.

01:10:49.995 --> 01:10:50.829
You're not him.

01:10:53.374 --> 01:10:54.291
Young Lady.

01:10:54.792 --> 01:10:57.253
Young Master Jang decides to stay
at Jeongjingak.

01:10:58.545 --> 01:11:00.589
I guess no one told you where he'd be.

01:11:01.173 --> 01:11:02.466
You must have been worried.

01:11:02.549 --> 01:11:06.762
He's been staying there ever since
you visited Songrim to introduce yourself.

01:11:06.845 --> 01:11:09.265
So then, you two
must not have been together since.

01:11:09.348 --> 01:11:12.393
No one can take care of him
since it's empty.

01:11:12.977 --> 01:11:14.520
Why is he there on his own?

01:11:14.603 --> 01:11:16.397
Maybe someone at home
makes him uncomfortable.

01:11:21.986 --> 01:11:23.112
Young Lady,

01:11:23.195 --> 01:11:25.823
let's pack for the young master
and go visit him there.

01:11:25.906 --> 01:11:27.908
I'm sure he's there
because it's comfortable.

01:11:28.534 --> 01:11:29.576
If you ever see him,

01:11:30.911 --> 01:11:33.247
please let him know
that I am well and comfortable here…

01:11:34.957 --> 01:11:36.542
just as much as he is over there.

01:11:48.387 --> 01:11:51.432
Please, if there's anything
you'd like to give him, I can take it.

01:11:51.515 --> 01:11:52.891
I will give it to him there.

01:11:52.975 --> 01:11:55.769
Why would I ask you to do
such a thing, Young Lady Heo,

01:11:56.729 --> 01:11:58.981
when his betrothed,
Young Lady Bu-yeon is here now.

01:12:00.691 --> 01:12:03.736
You need not to worry about him anymore.

01:12:06.363 --> 01:12:07.573
Oh, yeah.

01:12:12.161 --> 01:12:14.288
So why hasn't he been coming home?

01:12:16.040 --> 01:12:17.374
Is it really because of me?

01:12:18.083 --> 01:12:19.585
Let's go now, my husband.

01:12:19.668 --> 01:12:21.420
I was telling you
to take off that cumbersome robe.

01:12:21.503 --> 01:12:22.629
You think I was asking that?

01:12:23.213 --> 01:12:26.091
If you drink that, it means
we are officially married, all right?

01:12:27.134 --> 01:12:28.594
I do not wish to go back.

01:12:28.677 --> 01:12:31.347
I like it here. And I like you.

01:12:35.434 --> 01:12:37.811
He's probably scared
I'll throw myself at him again.

01:12:39.146 --> 01:12:41.398
Ugh, then he'll hate it if I went to him.

01:12:41.482 --> 01:12:44.401
If you regain your memories like this,
your divine powers will return.

01:12:44.485 --> 01:12:45.986
I'm glad I brought you with me.

01:12:47.446 --> 01:12:49.365
If I go and tell him
I remembered something,

01:12:50.199 --> 01:12:51.492
he would like that though, right?

01:12:56.455 --> 01:12:57.289
Maidservant Kim.

01:12:59.041 --> 01:13:00.459
I must go and see him now.

01:13:01.543 --> 01:13:03.212
Could you please
pack his belongings for me?

01:13:09.885 --> 01:13:10.719
My lady.

01:13:11.762 --> 01:13:12.846
Let me come with.

01:13:14.014 --> 01:13:15.808
I simply can't wait
to see Jang Uk anymore.

01:13:15.891 --> 01:13:17.851
It seems like he was avoiding you.

01:13:17.935 --> 01:13:19.353
What if he's unhappy to see you?

01:13:20.020 --> 01:13:22.106
I never said I was hoping
he'd be pleased to see me.

01:13:22.689 --> 01:13:26.652
I said that I simply could not wait
to see him anymore, did I not?

01:13:26.735 --> 01:13:30.072
But Sun-i, it seems you're hoping
he won't be pleased to see me.

01:13:30.948 --> 01:13:31.782
Why?

01:13:33.409 --> 01:13:35.035
Because that's what your young lady wants?

01:13:36.954 --> 01:13:39.873
- My… My young lady was the first to--
- You seem to have a misunderstanding.

01:13:40.582 --> 01:13:42.876
I am worried about you, not jealous.

01:13:43.627 --> 01:13:47.297
I doubt he'll be pleased to see you,
either you or me.

01:13:49.716 --> 01:13:51.218
I can't really tell if you're being humble

01:13:51.301 --> 01:13:53.178
or condescending
by thinking we are the same?

01:13:53.262 --> 01:13:54.680
I was trying to advise you.

01:13:55.431 --> 01:13:57.099
Never mind if you don't understand.

01:14:03.230 --> 01:14:05.524
What is that in your hand?

01:14:08.485 --> 01:14:09.319
Have you seen this?

01:14:09.403 --> 01:14:10.237
That is…

01:14:11.155 --> 01:14:12.448
known as the yin-yang jade.

01:14:12.531 --> 01:14:13.449
A what?

01:14:14.158 --> 01:14:15.993
There's a red jade and a blue jade.

01:14:16.660 --> 01:14:18.996
The pair calls to each other. How did…

01:14:20.539 --> 01:14:22.249
How come you have it now?

01:14:22.332 --> 01:14:23.250
I found it.

01:14:24.501 --> 01:14:26.753
I took it with me
after the owner's stone tower fell.

01:14:27.337 --> 01:14:28.213
I'll return it soon.

01:14:28.297 --> 01:14:29.673
What do you mean by that?

01:14:29.756 --> 01:14:32.092
The owner of that blue jade is dead.

01:14:33.677 --> 01:14:34.761
Her name was Naksu.

01:14:35.554 --> 01:14:37.973
She was the one
who stabbed him in the chest.

01:14:38.056 --> 01:14:39.224
Naksu?

01:14:41.059 --> 01:14:42.311
I've heard that name.

01:14:43.103 --> 01:14:44.229
She was Jang Uk's enemy.

01:14:46.273 --> 01:14:48.942
You really don't know then, do you?

01:14:53.989 --> 01:14:56.283
Try giving it energy and call for him.

01:14:57.159 --> 01:14:58.535
Then you'll understand it all.

01:14:58.619 --> 01:15:02.206
See for yourself the reason
why no one believed you were…

01:15:03.957 --> 01:15:04.791
his bride.

01:15:38.408 --> 01:15:40.536
You don't even know him,
yet you followed him here.

01:15:40.619 --> 01:15:43.205
He would never think
of getting married ever again.

01:15:43.288 --> 01:15:47.251
Is it really true
that you and Uk are married?

01:15:47.334 --> 01:15:48.794
This is why she came here to meet us.

01:15:48.877 --> 01:15:51.338
She's having a hard time
coming to terms with you marrying Uk.

01:15:51.421 --> 01:15:53.757
To be honest, it's hard for me too.

01:15:53.840 --> 01:15:55.634
So you really didn't know
about any of this?

01:15:55.717 --> 01:15:58.929
See for yourself the reason
why no one believed you were…

01:15:59.012 --> 01:16:00.055
his bride.

01:16:07.145 --> 01:16:07.980
Young Master.

01:16:08.814 --> 01:16:10.023
Did you just get here?

01:16:10.107 --> 01:16:11.650
Yes, would you draw a bath,
Maidservant Kim?

01:16:11.733 --> 01:16:13.151
What about Young Lady Bu-yeon?

01:16:14.861 --> 01:16:17.739
Did you not see the girl?
She said she was going to see you.

01:16:17.823 --> 01:16:20.033
She even packed
some honey biscuits to bring you.

01:16:22.035 --> 01:16:23.412
You must have missed each other.

01:16:23.996 --> 01:16:25.455
She seemed to be really worried

01:16:25.539 --> 01:16:27.499
because she had no idea
where you could be.

01:16:38.552 --> 01:16:40.470
She's probably out there looking for you.

01:18:13.647 --> 01:18:17.234
I regained another memory,
and now I can do this.

01:18:19.736 --> 01:18:20.737
Was it you who called me?

01:18:22.239 --> 01:18:23.865
I heard they were a pair so I tried it.

01:18:30.706 --> 01:18:31.998
I was the one who called you.

01:18:32.833 --> 01:18:34.000
But I guess I'm not the one…

01:18:36.336 --> 01:18:37.337
you came here to find.

01:18:41.425 --> 01:18:43.093
I frantically rushed over here.

01:18:44.386 --> 01:18:46.012
You better have a good reason for this.

01:18:46.096 --> 01:18:47.931
If I tell you something
you wanted to hear,

01:18:49.141 --> 01:18:50.100
will that be enough?

01:18:54.479 --> 01:18:56.106
I regained another memory today.

01:19:00.193 --> 01:19:01.737
For a very long time now…

01:19:05.031 --> 01:19:06.408
you and I have liked each other.

01:19:51.119 --> 01:19:54.039
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:19:54.122 --> 01:19:56.875
A lot of people were massacred
on the boat at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:19:56.958 --> 01:19:58.293
They say it was Naksu's doing.

01:19:58.376 --> 01:20:01.546
The soul shifter that has appeared now,
Naksu is the one.

01:20:01.630 --> 01:20:03.882
Since you're concerned about this,
I'll get rid of her myself.

01:20:03.965 --> 01:20:05.592
How do you expect him
to get rid of something

01:20:05.675 --> 01:20:06.635
that doesn't exist?

01:20:06.718 --> 01:20:10.055
These ridiculous rumors
could end up killing your daughter.

01:20:10.138 --> 01:20:12.641
By the way,
are you very ill by any chance?

01:20:12.724 --> 01:20:14.184
What do I have inside my body?

01:20:14.267 --> 01:20:16.770
I thought of holding a banquet
outside the palace.

01:20:16.853 --> 01:20:19.940
If Jin Bu-yeon does get attacked,
it will be Naksu's doing.

01:20:20.023 --> 01:20:22.734
And Jang Uk will have to take the blame
for all of it.
